  G --> H
  H --> I[Single UART owner and STS3215 five joints]
  C --> J[LED color at 3 percent]
  B --> K[Bounded session logger]
  C --> K
  G --> K
  I --> K
  K --> L[ROS13 observation replay and rosbag verification]
